7. Having heard the learned counsel for the parties and in the facts and circumstances of the case, as an ad-interim measure, it is directed that in the event of arrest of the applicants, Swami Hansdev alias Hansraj, Som Nath Narang and Manohar Lal Khurana, they shall be released on interim bail on executing a personal bond of Rs.30,000/- and two reliable sureties, each of the like amount, by each one of them, to the satisfaction of the Investigating Officer/Arresting Officer,
